Package: jewbuntu-lubuntu
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jewbuntu Developers <maintainers@jewbuntu.invalid>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: lxqt-panel, pcmanfm-qt, jewbuntu-branding
Recommends: shulgo-xfce
Homepage: https://jewbuntu.com
Description: Jewbuntu skin for Lubuntu (LXQt)
 A light Jewbuntu skin over Lubuntu's LXQt desktop. Lubuntu itself is not
 changed and keeps getting Ubuntu's updates. This adds:
  - a Star of David as the start-menu button on the panel
  - the blue Star of David wallpaper on the desktop and the login screen
    (in place of Lubuntu's default picture; a wallpaper you chose is kept)
  - Jewbuntu's short startup jingle at sign-in (from jewbuntu-branding)
  - ShulGo's minyan widget in the panel (recommended package shulgo-xfce)
